                      "width": 3,
                      "height": 50
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "wBkxP",
                      "name": "Mobile / 引文内容",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "没有宏大的计划，只是几盆薄荷、迷迭香和邻居们留下的小木牌。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.65,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "TqLdM",
                  "name": "Mobile / 引言",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "上周五，楼道尽头那块一直堆着旧纸箱的公共阳台终于被清了出来。起因只是群里有人问了一句：这里能不能放几盆大家都可以摘的香草？没想到当晚就有十几个人报名。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.78,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "YAd04",
                  "name": "Mobile / 小标题一",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "从一张征集纸开始",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 20,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KHkSW",
                  "name": "Mobile / 段落一",
                  "fill": "$text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "我们没有先建复杂的群，也没有列很长的规则，只在电梯旁贴了一张认领表。有人负责清理，有人带来旧木箱，还有人把家里多余的花盆、麻绳和标签笔放在门口。三天里每个人只做一件小事，阳台就慢慢有了样子。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.78,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
